Error [jet.ConcurrentCaptureNotOwned]: `seen` cannot cross the `parallel worker` boundary: the value writes shared state
  --> tests/ui/parallel_mutable_capture.jet:4:21
    |
  4 |     values.para_map(fn(n: Int) {
    |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The `parallel worker` boundary can run concurrently with its owner; the write would race with the owner or require a hidden merge rule
 Fix: Give it away with `.move()`, freeze it with `freeze`, or share it with `Shared{…}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1101
